SDK sources: add missing <array> includes (GCC-15 class).

15 files use std::array without including <array>; GCC 15's libstdc++
stopped providing it transitively (std::array is only forward-declared
via stl_pair.h) -> "field has incomplete type std::array<...>", first
fired by att-tool/att_lib_wrapper.hpp:102. Full-source sweep; the
include is added to every direct user so the class is closed corpus-
wide rather than halt-by-halt.

